Infuse your shield with light, healing you for [12, 16, 20, 22, 25 (TL1-5; SP 100)] each time you take damage at the expense of up to 2 positive energy.

If you do not have any positive energy, the effect will not trigger.

Additionally, once per turn successful melee attacks will trigger a bonus attack with your shield dealing [41%, 54%, 64%, 72%, 80% (TL1-5)] light damage.

The healing done will increase with your Spellpower.
